flowchart TB
  accTitle: Two pre-norm residual paths
  accDescr: Input x splits into an unchanged residual and a LayerNorm then causal attention branch. Their sum is u. u splits again into an unchanged residual and a second LayerNorm then MLP branch. The final sum is y. Both additions preserve B by T by C.
  X["x · [B, T, C]"] --> N1["LayerNorm → causal attention"]
  X -->|"unchanged x"| U["Add → u · [B, T, C]"]
  N1 --> U
  U --> N2["LayerNorm → MLP: C → 4C → C"]
  U -->|"unchanged u"| Y["Add → y · [B, T, C]"]
  N2 --> Y
